      "extract": "We start with describing a main constituent element of hyperbolic 3- manifolds with boundaries, called a hyperbolic truncated tetrahedron with one ideal vertex which is a polyhedron in the hyperbolic 3-space H 3 bounded by three right-angled pentagons with one ideal vertex, one right-angled hexagon and three triangles (see Fig. 1.3). Before giving the precise definition in Proposition 1.3, we prepare some formulae",
