      "extract": "with totally geodesic boundary of genus g In this section we construct infinitely many mutually non-isometric hyper- bolic 3-manifolds with totally geodesic boundary of genus g by using the mani- fold Ml described above. First we give a complete hyperbolic structure to the manifold Ml by realiz- ing the tetrahedra in §2 as the hyperbolic truncated tetrahedra which we give just below. Let g be any integer greater",
